## Filenames and slugs

- Prefer kebab-case for new files: `my-new-doc.md`.
- Use `system.prompt.md` for canonical persona prompts.
- Keep filenames stable to preserve external references.

## Linking

- Use relative links; verify rendering on GitHub.
- Prefer descriptive link text over raw URLs.
- Update all inbound links when renaming or relocating documents.

## Indices and cross-references

- Add new items to the relevant folder `README.md` lists.
- Cross-link related materials (e.g., a spec to its supporting philosophy) with relative paths.
